# yapnr: the runtime dependencies of the yapnr package, and nothing else.
#
# These lines are the `Requires-Dist` of the yapnr wheel (//release:wheel) and
# the input of the container image's runtime locks (docker/yapnr/runtime-*.lock,
# regenerated with tools/image/update_runtime_locks.sh). Each line also appears,
# character for character, in requirements.in, which Bazel resolves into
# requirements.lock; the runtime locks are constrained to those pins, so the
# image runs exactly the versions `bazel test` runs. A repository test
# (tests/unit/repo/test_images.py) keeps the three files consistent.
